              "type": "text",
              "text": "Closing a pane kills the PTY underneath it. Panes should be views — closing one should detach, and restoring should reattach to the same session. Start with terminal and chat panes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "message-pane-assistant",
          "role": "assistant",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-25T18:39:00.000Z",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The pane currently owns the process lifetime, so its cleanup kills the PTY. I’ll move ownership into the session manager so panes only hold a handle, then restore by session ID."
            },
            {
              "type": "tool",
              "id": "tool-pane-read",
